# Source

```rust
pub struct NoClone {
    pub value: u32,
}
#[derive(Clone)]
pub struct Private(pub u32, u32);
#[derive(Clone)]
#[non_exhaustive]
pub struct NonExhaustive {
    pub value: u32,
}
#[derive(Clone)]
pub enum Blocked {
    #[non_exhaustive]
    Unit,
}
